sequenceDiagram
    actor "Flutter Mobile Client" as FlutterMobileClient
    participant "Backend API Host" as BackendAPIHost
    participant "Reading Module" as ReadingModule
    participant "PostgreSQL Database" as PostgreSQLDatabase

    activate BackendAPIHost
    FlutterMobileClient->>BackendAPIHost: 1. 1. POST /api/v1/library
    BackendAPIHost-->>FlutterMobileClient: 10. HTTP 402 Payment Required
    BackendAPIHost->>BackendAPIHost: 2. 2. Auth Middleware: Validate JWT & Claims
    BackendAPIHost-->>BackendAPIHost: User is authenticated 'Free User'
    activate ReadingModule
    BackendAPIHost->>ReadingModule: 3. 3. MediatR.Send(new AddLibraryItemCommand(...))
    ReadingModule-->>BackendAPIHost: 9. Throws LimitExceededException
    BackendAPIHost->>BackendAPIHost: 9. 9a. Global Exception Middleware: Map LimitExceededException to HTTP 402
    BackendAPIHost-->>BackendAPIHost: Generates structured error response
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 11. 11. Dio Interceptor: Detect 402 status code
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 12. 12. Trigger Navigation to Upgrade Prompt UI

    note over BackendAPIHost: Using HTTP 402 'Payment Required' is a semantically correct and specific way to signal that the a...
    note over ReadingModule: The limit value (e.g., 20) MUST be sourced from a configuration service (e.g., appsettings.json o...

    deactivate ReadingModule
    deactivate BackendAPIHost
